nativeRuntimeSource standard.convert "SemanticScript/runtime/native_convert/sem_convert_runtime.c"
purpose module standard.convert "Canonical standard-library module for conversion helpers."
moduleOwns standard.convert "The official import path `standard.convert` and this module's implementation body."
moduleDoesNotOwn standard.convert "App-specific wrappers, compatibility aliases, or generated build artifacts."
invariant module standard.convert "The standard module entry is this file; tests live beside it as `main.test.sem`; the native-formatter operations delegate through runtimeBinding rows to sem_convert_runtime.c so they link in native/webServer builds."

