invariant operation convertSignedInt64ToBool "Equivalent to inputValue != 0."
guarantee convertSignedInt64ToBool "Total."
label startConvertSignedInt64ToBool
storage module immutable int64ToBoolZero Int64 0
storage module immutable int64ToBoolFalse Bool false
storage module immutable int64ToBoolTrue Bool true
call int64ToBoolZeroCall math.equalInt64
argument int64ToBoolZeroCall left Int64 inputValue
argument int64ToBoolZeroCall right Int64 int64ToBoolZero
run int64ToBoolZeroCall
bind value int64ToBoolIsZero Bool int64ToBoolZeroCall
branch if condition int64ToBoolIsZero target int64ToBoolReturnFalse
return value int64ToBoolTrue
label int64ToBoolReturnFalse
return value int64ToBoolFalse

